                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.00 Nazi/16: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-03-07T12:00:00-03:00">March 7,
                        1938—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received March 7—11:15 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>47. My 42, February 27, 8 p.m. The Minister of Justice informed me last night
                    that the Government will shortly issue a decree law for the purpose of further
                    curtailing the activities of foreign political organizations. The decree law
                    will stipulate drastic penalties for infringements.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
